This repo is SvelteKit with Svelte 5 in runes mode.

- Use `$state`, `$derived`, `$props`, `onclick={...}` — not `$:` / `export let` / `on:click`.
- Do **not** paste or attach the full Svelte documentation into prompts.
- For Svelte/SvelteKit questions, look up sections through the Svelte MCP (`list-sections`, then `get-documentation`).
- Run `svelte-autofixer` on any `.svelte` / `.svelte.ts` you write or edit.
